sequenceDiagram
    actor Patient
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Patient->>API: POST /appointments with Idempotency-Key
    API->>API: Validate JWT, patient role, body and future timezone-aware instant
    API->>DB: Lookup idempotency key
    alt Identical prior request
        DB-->>API: Existing appointment
        API-->>Patient: Original appointment response
    else Key reused with different request
        API-->>Patient: 409 Conflict
    else New request
        API->>DB: Check active doctor and exact-time conflicts
        API->>DB: Insert appointment and commit transaction
        DB-->>API: Persisted appointment
        API-->>Patient: 201 Created
    end
